.SH UPSTREAM INSPIRATION
saphira-bridge was inspired by Madhav Khosla's
.I arp-from-scratch
project, in particular its userspace Layer 2 MAC-learning bridge component:
.UR https://github.com/madhavkhoslaa/arp-from-scratch
.UE .
No source code or implementation structure from that Rust project is copied or
transliterated. The upstream repository carried no licence when reviewed, so this
is an independent C implementation based on standard Ethernet bridging behaviour
and Linux and IEEE 802.1D semantics. The credit is for the idea.
